Merged the early returns into a single return path and reuse the already-loaded `type` as the invalid fallback, avoiding a separate constant materialization. The common invalid-type path now falls through to the profile check without extra return blocks.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetType() const
{
    if ( type == FIT_UINT8_INVALID )
    {
        if ( ( profile != NULL ) && ( profileIndex < profile->numFields ) )
            return profile->fields[profileIndex].type;
    }

    return type;
}
```